window.products.push({"id":738053,"name":"Morning Alarm Clock, Superway Morning Call Home Smart Light Table Desk Calendar LED Digital Travel Alarm Clock Date Display Repeating Snooze and Senso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41es1GRcI-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Features 1. Large size LCD calendar2. Smart Light Function: smart lamp technology is to use a soft light at night can see the time , but not dazzling and affect sleep, more important is the power, and smart lights can freely switch3. With temperature display, free to convert Fahrenheit and Celsius 4. With alarm snooze function: When the bell rang , click the top button, the ringing stopped, it will continue to ring for 5 minutes; alarm tone gradient5. White background nightlights, perpetual calendar, 24 / 12 hours to convert6. Extremely simple operation settings, basic instructions can operate without looking set. Time Set Push bar to the end, TIME SET. You can see time flashes on display: ready to be set.Press HOUR and MIN to adjust.Push bar to LOCK to confirm your setting. Date Set Push bar on DATE SET position. Year, month and date flashes on display.Press YEAR, MONTH and DATE to adjust.Push bar to LOCK to confirm. Alarm Set AL.SET is to set alarm. AL.ON and AL.OFF is to control alarm status.Push bar on AL.SET position. Alarm flashes on display.Press HOUR and MIN to adjust.Push bar to LOCK to confirm. After alarm setting, do remember to push the left bar to AL.ON. At this time, alarm is on and will go off. You can see 2 little marks between hour and minute. It can be 12-hour time or 24-hour time. Temperature C/F Press MIN/DATE to alternate between Celsius and Fahrenhite. Sensor Turn on/off Sensor via the switch button on the back. Sensor gives off soft light to help you see time from short distance hands free. Nightlight and snooze Touch the top of the clock to activate snooze and nightlight. Warranty: Every sale includes an 12-month, worry-free guarantee to prove the importance we set on quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41es1GRcI-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Superway","source_asin":"B00Y0HRSW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y0HRSW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y0HRSW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
