window.products.push({"id":738080,"name":"Mirraco 74116 16\" Mirror Hanger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E73LogxKL._AC_SL1389_.jpg","description":"These CRL Mirraco? Mirror Hangers are an excellent choice for larger mirror installations. This system provides greater holding strength than comparable hangers. Installation time is reduced because there are no holes to drill in the mirror, plus the mirror can be centered before hanging. Each set includes upper and lower hanger strips, four clips, screws, and complete mounting instructions. This system offers a complete range of Hanger Sets from 16\" to 54\" (406 mm to 1.37 m). Easy-to-Install: 1. Position and secure bottom hanger to wall. 2. Position top hanger 1/2\" lower than eight of mirror and secure to wall. 3. Push top clips up install mirror (bottom first). Push top clip down to hold mirror. NOTE: Hangers are Stamped Top or Bottom. Important Notes: Use screw anchors or tap into wall studs when mounting mirror clips or hangers in the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E73LogxKL._AC_SL1389_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CR Laurence","source_asin":"B0813SYVGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0813SYVGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0813SYVGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738081,"name":"Vickerman 9' Carolina Pencil Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree, Unlit - Faux Christmas Tree - Seasonal Indoor Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":215.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813NzbUP5KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vickerman 9' x 44\" Carolina Pencil Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree, featuring 1525 PE/PVC Tips. This realistic tree comes unlit, it is made with a beautiful blend of rich green PE and PVC tips on metal hinged branches, a Metal tree stand is included. For additional complimentary accents see the many wreaths and garlands available from Vickerman. This durable tree is maintenance free and will suit any decor. Vickerman has been an industry leader since 1940. Enjoy this expert designed seasonal tree around your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813NzbUP5KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vickerman","source_asin":"B00NVR3MSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NVR3MSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NVR3MSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738082,"name":"Verve Culture 8.5'' Tortilla Press/Homemade Tortilla Maker/Handmade Aluminum Tortilla Press","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71veCu-6YCL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","description":"In Mexico, tortillas are a staple. They’re so easy to buy, but we’re obsessed with the homemade ones. Chewy in the middle, crispy edges, with a delicious slightly corn-y taste. They win brownie points at date night, themed dinners, and potlucks. They’re also super easy to make. Once you try it once, you won’t go back to store-bought. Trust us on this. (The Large size is ideal for tacos and burritos!) Easy as pie Mix equal parts wasa corn flour (widely available in grocery stores) with water; make a golf ball-sized dough, put it in the press, and close it. Press once, rotate, and gently press again. Cook ~1 minute on each side. For more details, check out our recipe. Instant street cred We once gifted a tortilla press to our friend Ben, who now takes the tortilla press to every Taco Tuesday and Mexican-themed night. Once he pulls out the tortilla press, all the ladies join him for tortilla-making. The tortilla press isn’t a puppy, but it’s close. Made from recycled parts Our Large Tortilla Press is made from recycled aluminum. Though lighter than cast iron, the large size of this press will still give you uniform, flat tortillas - and lasts forever. Our artisans have highly polished this press to make it a show-stopper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71veCu-6YCL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Verve CULTURE","source_asin":"B07Z6Q6XDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z6Q6XDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z6Q6XDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
