window.products.push({"id":738142,"name":"ARCOS Salmon Knife / Fish Knife 11 Inch Nitrum Stainless Steel and 290 mm blade. Ergonomic Polyoxymethylene POM Handle. Series Universal. Long, sturdy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41udNdh3yAL._AC_SL1383_.jpg","description":"Arcos Universal Salmon Knife with a high quality steel blade for the kitchen. With this knife you can cut salmon into slices of any diameter to enjoy its exquisite flavour. It has a blade with alveoli that helps you to make better cuts, avoiding food residue on the knife. PRECISION AND DURABILITY: This fish knife is made using a patented technique by Arcos called Nitrum, which provides increased durability, hardness, and high precision cutting. It is the result of shaping stainless steel with nitrogen to obtain a powerful and ultra-resistant tool. CLASSIC AND SAFE DESIGN: Handle designed for daily use without losing design, where straight lines with large formal contrasts and color predominate. It's made of polyoxymethylene (POM) so it is highly resistant to detergents and extreme temperature. It can be cleaned using chemicals and is suitable for the dishwasher. DIMENSIONS: This fish knife measures 410 mm in length and weighs 185 grams. Size Blade: 290 mm | 11” Inch making it a great tool for all your kitchen cutting needs. ARCOS: A family-owned business with a legacy of craftsmanship dating back to 1734. Almost three centuries of research and continuous improvement of our products make Arcos an international benchmark in the cutlery sector. From Albacete, Spain, we produce 11,000,000 knives every year that combine knowledge, design and innovation in order to achieve the highest quality standards. We distribute our unique pieces in over 70 countries around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41udNdh3yAL._AC_SL1383_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARCOS","source_asin":"B0C188GC73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C188GC73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C188GC73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
