window.products.push({"id":738331,"name":"Glass Baron Angel holding a Dove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HXPmiXHvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Purple Angelic Figurine holding White Dove with Swarovski Crystal Eyes Attached on Mirror Base Handcrafted by Glass Baron Glass Baron ~ High Quality, individually hand-crafted glass figurine. ✅Handcrafted figurine of an angel holding a dove, placed on a hand beveled glass mirror. ✅Accented with Genuine Swarovski Crystal Eyes and Real 22Kt Gold ✅3.5\"H x 2.75\"W x 2.5\"D ✅Made by Glass Baron ✅Model # A2 882  The beautiful Glass Baron collection of glass figurines are designed from high-quality, three-dimensional hand-blown glass. Each glass figurine piece is skillfully handcrafted using one or more of the following techniques:  ✅ Sandblasting the surface of the glass where thousands of microscopic chips of glass are removed to achieve a frosted finish.  ✅Airbrushing adds natural color enhancements by skilled airbrush artist who hand paint each piece using the highest quality, custom made paints.  ✅Each of the porcelain and clay flowers are handmade individually applied to the glass sculptures.  Glass Baron is a line of hand-crafted glass figurines featuring a variety of subjects. Details are all applied by hand, and include 22 karat liquid gold, Swarovski crystal accents, and porcelain. All pieces are individually and securely packed in Glass Baron brand boxes, perfect for gifting. Each Glass Baron piece is made with great care, and is guaranteed to be a fantastic accent piece to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HXPmiXHvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glass Baron","source_asin":"B0071LM234","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0071LM234","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0071LM234","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
