window.products.push({"id":738401,"name":"YouCustomizeIt Polka Dot Butterfly Finger Tip Towel - Full Print (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6113Rf-ZH7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Searching for a smaller, yet still decorative, towel for your bathroom? These fingertip towels are a perfect size; they're smaller than hand towels, but larger than your typical washcloths. Their size makes them an ideal addition to any small fixtures in your bathroom, but their vibrant colors will add a splash of personality to any bathroom in your home!These decorative fingertip towels feature two textures, giving you a luxurious feel while displaying your customization. The front of this towel is crafted from a soft, smooth polyester and displays your design in bold, vibrant colors, across the entire face. The back of this personalized towel is made from white, cotton terry loops, making these towels very absorbent and plush. Each white fingertip towel measures at approximately 11 by 18 inches.When cleaning your custom hand towels, we recommend that you toss them in the washing machine, with warm water and mild detergent. We advise that you avoid harsh detergents, and use non-chlorine bleach if absolutely necessary. Tumble dry on low heat to dry.Design Shown: Polka Dot Butterfly (#193625)Features:==================================== * [Perfect Size]: Smaller than hand towels but larger than washcloths, ideal for smaller bathroom fixtures. * [Dual Texture]: Soft, smooth polyester front for design display and cotton terry loop back for absorbency. * [Single-Sided Print]:Single-sided front print that covers the entire front of the towel, while the back remains white. * [Easy Care]: Machine washable in warm water with gentle detergent, tumble dry on low heat for convenience.Care Instructions:==================================== * Machine-wash in warm water with gentle detergent * Use non-chlorine bleach if necessary * Tumble on low heat to dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6113Rf-ZH7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YouCustomizeIt","source_asin":"B00WBSZUS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WBSZUS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WBSZUS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
