window.products.push({"id":738429,"name":"Hookah Blanket, Beach Blanket Sandproof , Newly Upgraded Oversized(83” X 99”) and Waterproof Beach Mat , Fits 4-5 People,Soft Polyester Material, Port","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgshjR5aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>☀Sandproof Waterproof : This oversized beach mat is fully sandproof, waterproof, and windproof. </p><p>Just gently shake or wipe the blanket to easily remove sand. This beach blanket is equipped with  4</p><p>sturdy anchor stakes, which easily affix the mat to the sand and prevent the wind from blowing it </p><p>around.</p> <p>☀Comfort and Quality: This newly upgraded, fourth-generation beach mat is made of high quality 100% double-layer polyester. This makes it cool(Not easy to absorb heat), soft, comfortable, and easy to wash </p><p>and dry.</p> <p>☀Portable and Lightweight: The beach blanket weighs 0.88 pounds and fits nicely inside the small </p><p>storage bag(6” x 9”). When unfolded, the blanket is 83” x 99”, which can accommodate 4-5 adults at a time. This </p><p>beach mat is perfect for picnics and parties!</p> <p>☀All-Weather Beach Blanket: This beach blanket isn’t just for the beach! It also works great as a picnic blanket, </p><p>camping blanket, or water-resistant tarp. This is a great all-weather outdoor blanket for camping, hiking, </p><p>concerts, sporting events, or any other outdoor activity.</p> <p>☀What’s Included: Get all your beach essentials in one product! This set includes 1 oversized sandproof </p><p>beach blanket, 1 storage bag, 4 anchor stakes</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgshjR5aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RESUKT","source_asin":"B08BPGTHC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BPGTHC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BPGTHC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738430,"name":"ITSOFT 3pc Non-Slip Shaggy Chenille Bathroom Mat Set, Includes 24 x 21 Inches U-Shaped Contour Toilet Rug, 34 x 21 Inches Bathmat and 1 Toilet Lid Cov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JqXIndNbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extra softness: Protects you from cold and hard bathroom floor, its special fiber construction offers you extra softness, each microfiber pile is about 1\" long, making your feet surrounded by thousands of individual fiber shags and feeling like sinking into a deep cotton pile while you step on it. Fiber-locking: Unique fiber-locking technique, say goodbye to horrible fibre-dropping! This kind of chenille mat is composed of 3 layers: chenille fabric layer, middle sponge layer and bottom non-slip layer. This soft and durable bath rug is especially for you to decorate and warm your bathroom. Non-slip: Skid-resistant bottom is made of high quality PVC material. This backing helps keeping the mat firmly in place, that it won't slip or slide keeping you more safe and cozy. Place rug on dry smooth floor only. Great absorbency: The chenille area rug can absorb water quickly, it has strong water-absorbent ability because of plenty of fiber shags can keep your room floors dry and clean. Easy care: We suggest you to use washing machine who's load is more than 6kg, with mild detergent in cold water, hang to dry or air dry flat. The super soft material will not shrink or turn rough after the wash, keeping your bathroom rug in the same shape as the day you bought it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JqXIndNbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITSOFT","source_asin":"B0BSYX11G8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSYX11G8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSYX11G8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
