window.products.push({"id":738503,"name":"Pack of 12 Reusable Mesh Bags for Veggies & Fruit Shopping, Toy Storage, JARTON Mesh Produce Bags Washable & Zero Waste, Great for Grocery Shopping, T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wqd--3cbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stop Wasting Plastic Bags! Tired of wasting plastic bags on produce or guilty about creating more trash? Don’t worry! The reusable mesh produce bag just a great substitute for those annoying plastic produce bags which you are used to putting fruits and veggies in at the store! The mesh bag saves WAY more than money, and keeps harmful plastic from polluting landfills to protect our Mother Earth! More Sensible Opening Designs The small size mesh bag adopts sideways opening design, which not only makes the opening deeper to easily fit produce in, but also frees more space to hold produce when closed. Moreover, each bag features a quick cinch cord with ball cord lock to keep everything from rolling out and makes it incredibly easy to open and close. That’s much easier to use than plastic bags, because instead of tying or twisting the tops, you simply pull the drawstring! 3 Sizes & Tare Weight Tag for More Practical Use One set of 12 mesh bags comes with 3 sizes to meet the needs for various shapes & sizes of produce: 11.8” x 16.5” (L x 4), 11.8” x 13.4” (M x 5), 12.2” x 7.2” (S x 3). Works great not just for vegetables and fruit, but bulk food like grain/ rice/ lentil/ nuts due to the fine mesh. Besides, each bag sews with a tare weight tag in gram, oz, lb for deducting the weight of the bag when weighing bulk food. Quick & Easily Wash for Reuse No matter rinse the bag with vegetables and fruit in it at the sink, or just toss it in the wash with the laundry to freshen it up, the bag will be air-dry quick and as good as new for your next shopping trips. Serve more than just Produce Except for grocery produce purchase, you’ll be surprised by many other creative uses of the reusable vegetable bag, such as draining  kid’s bath toys, using as a laundry bag/ snack bag, hanging mess kits while camping and organizing necessities for travel!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wqd--3cbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REGER","source_asin":"B07FFVKL62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FFVKL62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FFVKL62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738504,"name":"HUIKWAN Small Digital Alarm Clock with Indoor Temperature,3 Levels Brightness,12/24Hr, Snooze, Battery Operated Desk Small Clock(Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JcashWOSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【Multi-Function Display】clock information including dual alarm and room temperature. Convertible to ℉/℃.12HR/24HR, easy to operate. Easy to read as a bedside alarm clock in the bedroom for children, teens and seniors. It runs on 2 AA batteries (not included, the cheapest carbon batteries you can find). ⏰【Mini Alarm Clock】Our clock is compact and lightweight at 3.5\" * 3\" * 1.2\" and weighs only 100 grams. The digital alarm clock face features a high-definition LCD screen and is the perfect alarm clock to place anywhere in your bedside home and office on your nightstand, bedside table or desk, or in your handbag when traveling. ⏰【3Level Brightness&Dual Alarm Clock】Electronic clock LCD display screen has three kinds of brightness: low,medium and high light,you are free to choose the brightness.Dual alarm clock-Could wake you and your companion up at different alarm time setting,or double waking-up service for you only ⏰【5-60 Minutes' Snooze For Heavy Sleepers】 The big snooze button helps you easily turn off the buzzer but don’t need to open your eyes and enjoy five minutes of sleep. The clock will alarm every 5 min and the default Snooze time is 2 min until you turn off the snooze mode by pressing any other buttons. You can also set snooze time by yourself. Perfect for heavy sleepers ⏰【HUIKWAN Service】HUIKWAN digital clocks are easy to operate, compact, lightweight, feature a 5 minute snooze function, and we offer a 30 day money back and 24 hour customer service. If you have any questions about the HUIKWAN bedroom clock, please feel free to contact us. We will get back to you within one business day to resolve your issue. Your satisfaction comes first.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JcashWOSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUIKWAN","source_asin":"B09XDT8342","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDT8342","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDT8342","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
