window.products.push({"id":738561,"name":"Citronella Orange White Pillar Candles Set of 2 - Mosquito Bug Repellent 3x6 Scented Unscented - Burning time 60 Hour - Indoor Outdoor Patio Wedding P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BCQAcsJML.jpg","description":"Introducing our HANDMADE paraffin wax Citronella Orange White pillar candles Mosquito Repellent in a convenient set of 2. Each 3x6 inch pillar candle is made with lead-free and 100% cotton wicks, ensuring a clean and smoke-free burn every time. Each candle, scented or unscented, is crafted with the highest quality paraffin wax and care. Perfect for any occasion, our unscented or scented pillar candles are a versatile choice for Weddings, Birthdays, Anniversaries, Housewarming, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Valentine's Day, or Mother's Day. With a long-lasting 60 hour burn time, you can enjoy the warm glow of our candles for hours on end. Plus, you can feel good about supporting a local business - all of our candles are proudly MADE in the USA. To ensure your candles arrive in perfect condition, we individually wrap each pillar candle in bubble wrap before packaging. For the best results, we recommend burning each pillar candle for 3 hours on the first burn. Always use an appropriate candle holder and place candles on a stable, heat-resistant surface away from drafts and flammable materials. Keep the wick trimmed to approximately ¼ inch before each use and never move the candle while burning or if the wax is hot. Also, never place candles directly on furniture surfaces and never leave a burning candle unattended. Thank you for choosing our handmade Citronella Orange White pillar candles Mosquito Repellent. Shop with confidence knowing that each candle is crafted with the highest quality paraffin wax and love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21BCQAcsJML.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07VHJTZ12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VHJTZ12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VHJTZ12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738562,"name":"happimess HPM1001A Oscar Round 8-Gallon Step-Open Trash Can with Free Mini Trash Can, Modern, Fingerprint Proof for Home, Kitchen, Office, Large:7.9 G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KxjatxbjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our round 8-gallon trash cans are an excellent addition to any home or office. Featuring a profile hinge that allows it to sit close to a wall or cabinet, it's finished in brushed stainless, a fingerprint resistant surface. As good as it looks, it's just as functional the step-on mechanism allows for a smooth opening and the removable plastic liner makes bag changes a cinch. For a limited time, get a matching, smaller 1. 3-gallon step-pedal trash bin FREE with your purchase of this style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KxjatxbjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"happimess","source_asin":"B07GVSY3N4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GVSY3N4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GVSY3N4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738563,"name":"Indians Spear Fishing Canvas Wall Art by Albert Bierstadt with Black Frame, 16 by 20-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J5VKOLDhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features native Americans spear fishing from a boat. Albert Bierstadt (January 7, 1830 - February 18, 1902) was a German-American painter best known for his lavish, sweeping landscapes of the American West. In obtaining the subject matter for these works, Bierstadt joined several journeys of the Westward Expansion. Though not the first artist to record these sites, Bierstadt was the foremost painter of these scenes for the remainder of the 19th century. Bierstadt was part of the Hudson River School, not an institution but rather an informal group of like-minded painters. The Hudson River School style involved carefully detailed paintings with romantic, almost glowing lighting, sometimes called luminism. An important interpreter of the western landscape, Bierstadt, along with Thomas Moran, is also grouped with the Rocky Mountain School. An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a dark wooden frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional frames and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J5VKOLDhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00H5NDT08","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H5NDT08","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H5NDT08","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
