window.products.push({"id":738576,"name":"BlackBull Genuine Viking Drinking Horn Mug - 100% Authentic Medieval Tankard. Drink Beer, Wine, Mead. Choice of Vikings & Game of Thrones Fans A Perfe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713CGXJDbmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drink, swig and rejoice like a Viking with your very own handmade horn tankard that’s sure to quench your thirst. These are real, drinking horn mugs, also known as horn tankards. This rustic rough style sports that looks a zillion good!These horn mugs hold about 16 ounces on average. Some may hold slightly more. ♦HOW IT'S MADE The BlackBull drinking horn is, of course, fashioned from real buffalo and ox horn, ethically sourced from produce farms in which the animals are harvested for their meat. Horns are never taken from live animals and the animals are NEVER harmed. Each horn is cut, cored, hand polished and sealed with food-safe lacquer on it's interior. Each horn is truly a unique piece of Viking lore. ♦QUALITY WORKMANSHIP BlackBull offers the finest quality medieval goods in all of Midgard. Inspired by medieval Scandinavian culture, BlackBull hearkens to a time when honor was everything and victory was sealed in blood!Our craftsmen use traditional techniques to mimic the function and appearance of medieval Nordic crafts. ♦CARING FOR YOUR TANKARD The BlackBull drinking horn is 100% food safe, as its interior is coated with a pure lacquer. Drink beer, mead, ale, liquor or any other cold beverage with confidence. However, do not drink extremely hot beverages out of your tankard, as horns can warp after repeated exposure to extreme heat. This also means you should not place the horn in your dishwasher. Besides, the Norsemen didn't have fancy dishwashing machines! Care for your horn like the Norse treasure that it is. ♦OUR TIME HONORED PROCESS Our craftsmen closely follow the traditional techniques of the ancient Norsemen when it comes to crafting the perfect horn mug. Only small improvements have been added to the original techniques. ♦ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713CGXJDbmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlackBull Drinkware","source_asin":"B07DT37Y7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DT37Y7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DT37Y7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
