window.products.push({"id":738641,"name":"Keurig K-Cafe Single Serve K-Cup Coffee, Latte and Cappuccino Maker with 96-Count Variety Pack Single Serve K-Cup Set Bundle (2 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611DHfNx0OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keurig K-Cafe Single-Serve K-Cup Coffee, Latte and Cappuccino Maker The Keurig K-Cafe Single-Serve K-Cup Coffee, Latte, and Cappuccino Maker creates a rich, full-flavored coffee that satisfies your taste buds. You can use any K-Cup pod to brew coffee or make delicious lattes and cappuccinos. Simple Button Control You can insert any K-cup pod and use the button controls to brew delicious coffee or make hot or iced lattes and cappuccinos. Large 60 oz. Water Reservoir It allows you to brew 6 cups before having to refill, saving you time and simplifying your morning routine. The removable reservoir makes refilling easy for smooth operation. Smart Start Your coffee maker heats, then brews in one simple process. You need not wait for it to heat before selecting your cup size. Energy Efficient The programmable auto-off feature automatically turns your brewer off 2 hours after the last brew for energy savings. Travel Mug Friendly It accommodates travel mugs up to 7.2-inch tall and is top-rack dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. It is compatible with My K-Cup Reusable Coffee Filter Brewer Maintenance Reminder It alerts you when it is time to descale your coffee maker. Descaling is an important process that removes built-up calcium deposits, ensuring the best-tasting brew possible. High Altitude Setting It ensures that your coffee maker works properly at altitudes of 5,000-feet. Bundle Includes: Keurig K-Cafe Single-Serve K-Cup Coffee, Latte and Cappuccino Maker Keurig K-Cafe Single-Serve K-Cup Coffee, Latte and Cappuccino Maker Bestpresso Coffee 96-Count Variety Pack Single Serve K-Cup Set (Breakfast, Colombian, Donut and Italian) Bestpresso Coffee 96-Count Variety Pack Single Serve K-Cup Set (Breakfast, Colombian, Donut and Italian)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611DHfNx0OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keurig","source_asin":"B09JWWS2SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JWWS2SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JWWS2SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
