window.products.push({"id":738706,"name":"Black+decker Cj625 30-watt 34-ounce Citrus Juicer, White- Make Easily Squeezed, Fresh Juice + E-book for You","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Ql+7p+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Black Decker Can be a great addition to your kitchen appliances. - Eye-catching electric juicer! -Enjoy freshly squeezed juice at home anytime. - Good quality and great value. Uniquely designed for your kitchen. The juicer’s uniquely designed reamer squeezes every last drop of juice of your fruits. All parts are dishwasher-safe for fast and easy cleanup. You can even use it for protein shakes - no more lumpy powdered milkshakes, this blender will evenly mix your protein so you get the best out of an evenly mixed protein shake. - Get a healthy kick start to the morning with a fresh Smoothie or juice which is packed with all the nutrients that we find in fruits. - Sturdy and durable.  Very sleek, classy and functional! So if you’re looking for an electric juicer, this is the one! Its a great product and its perfect for your foods. Go for it! Quit searching and just buy it. Special E-book from our store with additional discount on your next purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Ql+7p+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B01BST9WMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BST9WMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BST9WMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738707,"name":"Christmas Snow Globes, USB or Battery Operated Sparkly Glitter Snow Globe Cardinal Church Lantern with Musics for Christmas Decorations and Snow Globe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vv1oZn80L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄Amazing Christmas Decor: Well and Sturdy Constructed ,Antique look and feel christmas globe combines cardinal ,trees and church some of most favorite and greatest things.The lights, glitter, and \"snow\" swirling constantly bring to mind the wonderful season of Christmas and trips down memory lane.You will be attracted unconsciously and watch at.It is a beautifully crafted holiday ornament ❄Silent Mode or Music Mode:This globe lantern has a decent music box style sound that cyclically plays 8 Christmas songs with lights and swirling glitter when switch is turned to “Music Mode”.The other selection “Silent mode” turns the light and swirls on.It stays on for six hours and off for 18 hours to automatically turn on at whatever time you switched it on the day before.Stylish and looks beautiful whether or not it's turned on ❄USB Cord or Battery Operated:This glittery swirl snow globe lantern have two ways to power it, either with batteries(3x AA Required not included) or with a USB cable(included but does need the plug). Rather heavy so won’t easily tip over.You can put other objects around it to make a scene.The sparkle and the light are a nice addition to the holiday decor ❄Christmas Decoration&Gift: Globe lantern is very detailed and different on all sides but all sides have views of the lighted interior. The illuminated Christmas scene is amazing.Watching the swirl of snowflakes can almost relax you.The snow globe portion is so pretty, the light is super cheerful and the music really gets you into the holiday spirit.It is a great choice for Christmas present for your family and friends ❄What You Get: A Charming, unique and magical Musical Glitter Snow Globe Lantern with USB cable,8 Christmas songs.You will enjoy “Jingle Bells”,”We Wish You a Merry Christmas”,”Silent Night”,etc. And our satisfied after sell service.We proudly stand behind all of our products to help you solve your issue you meet, our number one goal is customer satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vv1oZn80L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greluna","source_asin":"B09BN2NSCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BN2NSCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BN2NSCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
