window.products.push({"id":738744,"name":"YONUFI Candle Accessory Set 4 in 1 - Candle Snuffer, Wick Trimmer, Wick Dipper with Plate Tray (Rose Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UaIaOFeEL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"4 in 1 Candle Care Tool Set - Enjoy the best performance from your candles with Candle Accessory Set, for those who love candles, this is the best tool kit to the take good care of our candles. FEATURES: ◼️Trimming candle wick to prevent soot and extend candle burning time. ◼️Reaches deep into tall pillar and jar candles. ◼️Candle wick dipper to put the wick into straight position to prevent smoldering. ◼️Made of polished stainless steel with rose gold plating for long term use. SPECIFICATIONS: Material : Urable Stainless Steel Color :Rose Gold Size : Candle snuffer - 8.9 inch; wick dipper - 7.9inch; wick trimmer - 7.1 inch; Storage Tray - 9.1 inch x 3.7 inch Gift Box Dimensions :9.8 inch x 1.7 inch x 4.5 inch Weight : Approx. 12.7 oz HOW TO USE: Candle Wick Trimmer : Quickly and easily trims wicks to the optimum length. Wick debris falls into the catcher Candle Wick Snuffer : Just cover the candle to extinguish the flame, it is the safest way to prevent hot wax from splattering Candle Wick Dipper : Press the burning candle core into the wax oil to extinguish it. Also helps prime the wick for future burning Candle platey tray : Functional as a aroma candle tray, candle wax tray, or candle care tools tray to prevent them from contaminating the desktop. PACKAGING: 1 x Candle Wick Trimmer 1 x Candle Wick Dipper 1 x Candle Snuffer 1 x Storage Tray Plate NOTE: Ensure that the product is clean and dry,.Do not wash with strong alkaline or corrosive liquids in case it gets rusted and the service life is affected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UaIaOFeEL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YONUFI","source_asin":"B08C35Q7S7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C35Q7S7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C35Q7S7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
