window.products.push({"id":738771,"name":"BlackGold [3 Pack] Compatible with iPhone 13 Pro Max Tempered Glass Screen Protector [Anti-Scratch] [3D Touch] [No Bubble] [Case Friendly] 5G (6.7 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pvecWZenL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Compatible with Phone 13 Pro Max 2021 (6.7-inch). Features: 1. High Transparent and Ultra-Clear: The oleo phobic coating keeps fingerprints and smudges away for a clear view of your phone's screen! Ultra-clear High Definition with 99.9% transparency to allow an optimal, natural viewing experience. 2. 3D Touch Sensitive: Ultra thin-0.2mm thickness is reliable and resilient, and promises full compatibility with touchscreen sensitivity. Our screen protector does not interfere with the touch response and bring you a perfect unlock experience, screen protector perfectly compatible with fingerprint sensor. 3. Anti-Scratch: 9H Hardness, harder than a knife's blade, can effectively protect your Phone from unwanted scuffs and scratches by knife, keys and some other hard substances. 4. Easy to Install: Our glass screen protector is easy to install and owe to plasma spary and auto-adsorption technology, our screen protector tempered glass can self-expel air bubble. After Sales Service: Feel free to contact us if you have any problem with your screen protectors or your order. We will provide you with satisfactory service. Package Included: 3 * iPhone 13 Pro Max Screen Protector 1 * Installation Kit 1 * Installation Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pvecWZenL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Black Gold","source_asin":"B09FT6F619","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FT6F619","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FT6F619","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":738772,"name":"Hunter 30546 PermaLife Three-Speed, Large-Room Air Purifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+47umzaaS._AC_SL1253_.jpg","description":"Lots of air purifiers come with filters that must be replaced, with the price being nearly that of the whole unit. Here's a way to get around spendy replacement filters. Designed to filter air in large rooms up to 510 square feet, the PermaLife air purifier from Hunter comes with a reusable HEPA filter that cleans easily with any household vacuum. That's right; the filter cleans easily for reuse and still captures 99.5 percent of particles down to 0.5 microns in size, eliminating pet hair, dust, lint, tobacco smoke smells, and more! And, by filtering room air six times over in one hour, prolonged cooking aromas and nasty pet odors are history. A separate ionizer enhances air cleaning and gives the room a fresh smell. Programmable, digital controls make it easy to adjust between setting options. An easy-to-read, LCD screen indicates which setting is active and how much life the filter has left in it. The PermaLife also comes with a remote control for easy operation from across the room. The unit's pre-filter protects the HEPA filter from larger particles for longer HEPA filtering. The carbon pre-filter also helps eliminate odors from smoking, cooking and other household odors, reducing common household odors 30 percent more efficiently than other leading brands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+47umzaaS._AC_SL1253_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hunter Fan Company","source_asin":"B000I1TW0A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000I1TW0A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000I1TW0A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
