window.products.push({"id":738775,"name":"Signature Sleep Comfort 9 Inch Soft Pillow Top Mattress Full Size Model 006","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z64LcTPmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get a restful night's sleep on this traditional spring soft foam top mattress from AS Quality. A quilted fabric cover and inner foam layer provide comfort and resilience, while heavy-gauge steel coils offer lasting support. Because your family's safety is as important as its comfort, this spring mattress has a fire resistant barrier that's tested to ensure it meets safety standards. For easy shipping and simple set up, this mattress comes compressed and rolled. This mattress is designed to help solve five common sleep problems: tossing and turning, back support and alignment, balanced sleep temperature, partner movement, sagging Comfort and feels plush with individually wrapped coil inner springs inside with euro top style on top. Diamond top style helps keep you cool by drawing body heat away from the sleeping surface and allows flow of the air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z64LcTPmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AS Quality Signature Mattress","source_asin":"B07667D4ZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-738775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07667D4ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07667D4ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
